@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100
@fileName = example.txt

### List files
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments

### Check whether a file exists
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments/exists?fileName={{fileName}}

### Upload a file
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments?overwrite=true
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=StorageBoundary

--StorageBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello from FileSystemSample.
--StorageBoundary--

### Get file information
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments/info?fileName={{fileName}}

### Get the local file URI
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments/full-path?fileName={{fileName}}

### Download a file
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments/content?fileName={{fileName}}

### Update metadata
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments/metadata?fileName={{fileName}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "sample"
}

### Delete a file
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments?fileName={{fileName}}
